{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"class","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MarketEventSymbols","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MarketEventSymbols","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"DXFeedFramework"}],"externalID":"s:15DXFeedFramework18MarketEventSymbolsC","roleHeading":"Class","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MarketEventSymbols","kind":"identifier"}]},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MarketEventSymbols","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Regional symbols"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Regional symbol subscription receives events only from a designated exchange, marketplace, or venue"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instead of receiving composite events from all venues (by default). Regional symbol is composed from a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"base symbol, ampersand character (’&’), and an exchange code character. For example,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“SPY” is the symbol for composite events for SPDR S&P 500 ETF from all exchanges,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“SPY&N” is the symbol for event for SPDR S&P 500 ETF that originate only from NYSE marketplace."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Symbol attributes"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Market event symbols can have a number of attributes attached to then in curly braces"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with “<key>=<value>” paris separated by commas. For example,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“SPY{price=bid}” is the mark